{"1527060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Gets Medieval", "steam_appid": 1527060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside the mundane world of mortals and rise as a feline champion destined for greatness. Gather your friends to  embark on a sweeping journey across a kingdom on the brink of ruin. Scale ancient battlements, infiltrate human settlements, and unleash your chaos upon  the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the depths of forgotten dungeons lie relics of immense power. Claim them to awaken elemental abilities: flames that roar from your throat, shadows that bend to your will, or beams of pure arcane force that blaze from your eyes. A greater challenge awaits you the royal crown lies shattered, its six fragments scattered across the land. Only by restoring it can you halt the encroaching darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new lands, solve their problems, or cause some of your own. It’s all open to you in this cat-tastic purrtacular adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest and explore a huge interactive open world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve the depths of crypts, caves, dungeons, and abandoned fortresses for lost artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can access unique powerful artifacts that aligns with their elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and development to improve your strength, health and magic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of quests and interactive characters</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside the mundane world of mortals and rise as a feline champion destined for greatness. Gather your friends to  embark on a sweeping journey across a kingdom on the brink of ruin. Scale ancient battlements, infiltrate human settlements, and unleash your chaos upon  the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the depths of forgotten dungeons lie relics of immense power. Claim them to awaken elemental abilities: flames that roar from your throat, shadows that bend to your will, or beams of pure arcane force that blaze from your eyes. A greater challenge awaits you the royal crown lies shattered, its six fragments scattered across the land. Only by restoring it can you halt the encroaching darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new lands, solve their problems, or cause some of your own. It’s all open to you in this cat-tastic purrtacular adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest and explore a huge interactive open world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve the depths of crypts, caves, dungeons, and abandoned fortresses for lost artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can access unique powerful artifacts that aligns with their elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression and development to improve your strength, health and magic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of quests and interactive characters</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore an amazing fantasy world as a magical cat! Team up with your cat crew, climb castle walls, blast magic, and hunt the six lost crown pieces to save the kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527060/header.jpg?t=1771960113", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse